{"path":"results/simple-ideas-4x6-p1-5-len2g1-comp0-7-scaling-ladder-20261024/summary.md","title":"Scaling: Easy graph (4 × 6)","html":"<h1>Scaling: Easy graph (4 × 6)</h1>\n<p><strong>Question:</strong> On a easy idea graph, how does what each society achieves grow with its budget (25 to 3200)?</p>\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> At budgets 25–50: best α = 1, β = 1. Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste; no clear difference on money to the main level. At budget 100: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste. At budget 200: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste; no clear difference on hardest level and knowledge found (bits). At budgets 400–3200: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on ROI, knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste; no clear difference on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value and knowledge found (bits). (Compared at each budget; 8 measures, a clear difference is more than 2.7 standard errors.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget 25: hardest level: 3.40 against traditional 0.13, clearly better. targets solved: 0.80 against traditional 0.03, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 50: hardest level: 3.90 against traditional 0.53, clearly better. targets solved: 1.47 against traditional 0.13, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 100: hardest level: 4.00 against traditional 2.00, clearly better. targets solved: 2.00 against traditional 0.57, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 200: hardest level: 4.00 against traditional 3.73, no clear difference. targets solved: 2.00 against traditional 1.60, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 400: hardest level: 4.00 against traditional 4.00, no clear difference. targets solved: 2.00 against traditional 2.00, no clear difference.</li>\n<li>Budget 800: hardest level: 4.00 against traditional 4.00, no clear difference. targets solved: 2.00 against traditional 2.00, no clear difference.</li>\n<li>Budget 1600: hardest level: 4.00 against traditional 4.00, no clear difference. targets solved: 2.00 against traditional 2.00, no clear difference.</li>\n<li>Budget 3200: hardest level: 4.00 against traditional 4.00, no clear difference. targets solved: 2.00 against traditional 2.00, no clear difference.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"files/results/simple-ideas-4x6-p1-5-len2g1-comp0-7-scaling-ladder-20261024/figures/compare.svg\" alt=\"Scaling: Easy graph (4 × 6)\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>society</th>\n<th>budget</th>\n<th>frontier</th>\n<th>targets solved</th>\n<th>value gained</th>\n<th>ROI (value per spend)</th>\n<th>knowledge (bits)</th>\n<th>bits per money</th>\n<th>cost</th>\n<th>waste</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>0.1 ± 0.7</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.2</td>\n<td>1 ± 6</td>\n<td>0.04 ± 0.24</td>\n<td>8 ± 2</td>\n<td>0.314 ± 0.100</td>\n<td>12 ± 0</td>\n<td>0.34 ± 0.15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>0.5 ± 1.4</td>\n<td>0.1 ± 0.3</td>\n<td>4 ± 11</td>\n<td>0.09 ± 0.23</td>\n<td>11 ± 3</td>\n<td>0.235 ± 0.060</td>\n<td>36 ± 17</td>\n<td>0.46 ± 0.13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>2.0 ± 2.0</td>\n<td>0.6 ± 0.6</td>\n<td>18 ± 20</td>\n<td>0.19 ± 0.22</td>\n<td>17 ± 3</td>\n<td>0.180 ± 0.037</td>\n<td>65 ± 23</td>\n<td>0.59 ± 0.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>3.7 ± 1.0</td>\n<td>1.6 ± 0.6</td>\n<td>51 ± 20</td>\n<td>0.35 ± 0.19</td>\n<td>23 ± 3</td>\n<td>0.145 ± 0.041</td>\n<td>100 ± 46</td>\n<td>0.68 ± 0.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>4.0 ± 0.0</td>